          <h3 class=\"faq-q\">How do you plan customer movement in a showroom?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">We place hero products near the entry, create a natural route through the store and keep the billing area visible but not in the way.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do you coordinate with brand and signage teams?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. As the interior architect for showroom design, we coordinate with your brand, signage and lighting vendors so everything fits together on site.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Showroom That Tells Your Story</h2>\n            <p>Customers remember how a store made them feel. Working with an interior architect for showroom design helps turn floor space into sales.</p><p>Opening or refreshing a showroom in Hauz Khas? <a href=\"/hauzkhas/contact\">Get in touch with 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}